%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: AlftandPt2Boogaloo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351134
    - rid: 4351268282100351135
    - rid: 4351268282100351136
    - rid: 4351268282100351137
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, in the next room there's gonna be some shovey pistons.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351138
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351139
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: They're really big, so we need to be careful to not get shoved into a
      pit.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever you say, {mc}-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh dang, those pistons <i>are</i> pretty big.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351140
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: How much steam is running through this place, anyway?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351141
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: A lot. I did say that the Dwemer were steampunk, didn't I?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351143
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So you did.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351142
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351144
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Now that I think about it, we should be scrapping all the Dwarven metal
      we can while we're down here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351145
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: In this room there should be some pieces lying around...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'Ah, there we are: some bent pieces of dwarven scrap.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I scoop up a few of the bigger pieces.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351146
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: What're you doing with that stuff, {mc}?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm gonna smelt it down later.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... why?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Because dwarven metal is stronger, more durable, and more valuable than
      steel.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, it'd be best to get our hands on some of it while we have the chance.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you want me to gather some, too?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351147
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That'd probably be for the best, just remember that we've got a lot of
      journey ahead of us before we're out of here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351148
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: If you say so, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351149
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351150
    - rid: 4351268282100351151
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ah, hold up, Monika. The Falmer are coming up.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Those other elves? What's their deal, anyway?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141355
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (They've been blind and kind of feral for millennia, thanks to be forced
      to eat some funky mushrooms by the Dwemer.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Huh?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351153
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (It's a whole thing; just know that they're blind and angry.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: As we make our way forward, wary of potential Falmer-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351154
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: An arrow whizzes past my head!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351155
    - rid: 4351268282100351159
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright, time to take this guy out!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351156
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268282100351157
    - rid: 4351268282100351158
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460672
    - rid: 4351268331346460673
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah right, this bit.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460674
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There should be some pipes around here that'll help us get down to that
      platform.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460675
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of us look around for a bit, and-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, these ones should do it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}... I don''t think that''s safe.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460676
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, it's either climb down those pipes or enjoy the fall.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You do it first then, {mc}...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460677
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, if you're gonna be that insistent...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I start navigating down the pipes, choosing to ignore the excessive fall
      awaiting me if I slip.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460678
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460679
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Plot armor, don't fail me now!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I reach the bottom of the pipes, get braced to jump and-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Safe!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460680
    - rid: 4351268331346460681
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}? Did you make it down there alright?'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I step toward the center of the platform, so that Monika can see me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: No, I'm still up there with you, can't you tell?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Monika dramatically sighs and starts making her way down the pipes, trying
      to mimic the path I took.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: She gets to the bottom and prepares to jump-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh, her ankle's at a bit of a weird angle...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460683
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: <Speed=20>OH SHI</Speed>-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141361
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>AAAAAAAAAaaaaaaahh</NoiseText>!!!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460684
    - rid: 4351268331346460685
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>wuld</font>!!!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460686
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I manage to grab onto Monika's right arm before... it's too late.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460687
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, can you swing your other arm to grab onto the platform?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... y-yeah...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460688
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Monika swings her body in such a way to grab onto the ledge with her
      left arm.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460689
    - rid: 4351268331346460690
    - rid: 4351268331346460695
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, I'll start pulling you up on the count of three, alright?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460691
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Three...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Two...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: One!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I pull her up with my all strength, and with Monika helping with her
      left arm, we manage to get her up on the platform.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460692
    - rid: 4351268331346460693
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Holy crap, that was close-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460694
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: An ice spike flies past from behind my head!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460696
    - rid: 4351268331346460697
    - rid: 4351268331346460699
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I whip my head around, finding the stupid Falmer mage that threw that
      icicle.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460698
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460700
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaaaahh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460763
    - rid: 4351268331346460765
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}...?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460766
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I need a break...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460767
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>Yeah</i>...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I lay down onto the cold hard floor, eager to let my body cool down after
      the adrenaline-fest we just went through.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460768
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Monika takes a seat on the pile of rubble at the center of the platform;
      I guess she thought that'd be more comfy.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268331346460769
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
